    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d837">

                <pb facs="0983" n="971" sameAs="frus:frus1943v03/pg971"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">390.1115A/1519: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Switzerland</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Harrison</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary
                        of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bern</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1943-03-18">March 18,
                        1943</date>.<lb/>[Received March 19—1:40 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1764. American interests Japan, Urawa camp. Department’s 370 February 12,
                    Legation’s 1586 March 9.<anchor n="29" xml:id="d837-f1"/> Foreign Office March
                    11 reports although Japanese authorities gave assurance install central <pb
                        facs="0984" n="972" xml:id="pg972"/> heating<anchor n="30" xml:id="d837-f2"
                    /> before end year, not one [<hi rendition="#italic">done?</hi>], end February,
                    only heating charcoal brazier reading room. Legation requested Foreign Office
                    inform Swiss Legation Tokyo present heating arrangements obviously insufficient,
                    necessary Japanese authorities either (1) install central heating system or (2)
                    adequate steps be taken heat camp. Also call attention Japanese authorities
                    adequate heating arrangements installed Japanese internment camps United States.
                    Reciprocal treatment expected.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Harrison</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d837-f1" n="29" xml:id="d837-f1-content">
                <p>Neither printed.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d837-f2" n="30" xml:id="d837-f2-content">
                <p>In the Urawa camp in Japan.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
